  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**\r\n\r\nIT8 is a set of ANSI standards for color communications and control specifications. I have audited source code of lcms library and I have founded a vulnerability in AllocateDataSet function (cmscgats.c). The attached it8 could crash lcms when ASAN was enabled on Linux."
